{"seq":3,"slug":"test-strategy-and-quality","title":"测试策略与质量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/test-strategy-and-quality","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"test-pyramid","title":"测试金字塔","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/test-strategy-and-quality/test-pyramid","wordCount":2493,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-coverage","title":"测试覆盖率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/test-strategy-and-quality/code-coverage","wordCount":2578,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"testable-architecture","title":"可测试架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/test-strategy-and-quality/testable-architecture","wordCount":2664,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"# 测试策略与质量 简介\n\n会写测试还不够——要把有限的精力**投到对的地方**，才能用最小成本守住质量。本章讲清测试策略：先是**测试金字塔**（为什么单元测试要多、集成测试居中、UI 测试要少——比例与取舍），然后是**测试覆盖率**（code coverage 真正的意义、以及把它当 KPI 的陷阱），最后是**可测试架构**（依赖注入、纯函数、解耦如何让代码天然可测——测试难写往往是设计问题）。测试不是越多越好，而是结构合理、覆盖关键、可维护。掌握测试策略，让测试成为开发的加速器而非负担。\n"}